1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,760
上次会议定了八件事，七件显示逾期
Last meeting set 8 tasks. 7 show as overdue.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,224
其实大部分早就做完了
Most were actually done long ago —

3
00:00:08,264 --> 00:00:09,860
只是没人回来更新
nobody came back to update them.

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,460
会上定的事，散会就忘
Decisions are forgotten the moment the meeting ends.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,060
纪要没人写，写了也没人看
No one writes the minutes, and no one reads them.

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,660
谁负责、做完没
Who owns it? Is it done?

7
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,660
最后都得去翻群聊
You end up digging through group chats.

8
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,877
这是散会即开工
This is Sanhui (Meeting → Action).

9
00:00:23,917 --> 00:00:26,032
AI 写纪要，现在谁都会
Any AI can write minutes now.

10
00:00:26,072 --> 00:00:27,649
它做的是下一步
Sanhui does the next step:

11
00:00:27,689 --> 00:00:29,804
把会上定的事变成任务
it turns decisions into tasks

12
00:00:29,844 --> 00:00:31,960
再跨会议一直跟到做完
and follows them across meetings until they're done.

13
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,691
会议软件一开麦
When your meeting app turns on the mic,

14
00:00:35,731 --> 00:00:37,757
右上角就会问你要不要录
a prompt in the corner asks if you want to record

15
00:00:37,797 --> 00:00:40,460
顺带告诉你，上次定的事做完了几件
and tells you how many tasks from last time are done.

16
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:48,655
录音分成你和对方两条声音
Audio is split into two tracks: you and the others.

17
00:00:48,695 --> 00:00:51,392
在你自己的电脑上离线转成文字
It's transcribed offline on your own computer.

18
00:00:51,432 --> 00:00:52,760
录音不出电脑
The audio never leaves your Mac.

19
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:58,540
散会后，AI 把任务挑出来
After the meeting, AI picks out the tasks:

20
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,645
谁做、做什么、什么时候交
who, what, and by when,

21
00:01:00,685 --> 00:01:02,049
每条带着原话
each with the original quote.

22
00:01:02,089 --> 00:01:05,030
我拿自己一场二十二分钟的会试过
I tried it on a 22-minute meeting of my own:

23
00:01:05,070 --> 00:01:06,960
四十六秒，提出七件事
46 seconds, 7 tasks.

24
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:11,087
点原话，就从录音里那一句开始播
Click the original quote to play from that exact line.

25
00:01:11,127 --> 00:01:13,560
当时谁怎么说的，一听就清楚
You hear exactly who said what.

26
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,813
AI 提出来的，先放在待确认
AI suggestions go to Pending review first.

27
00:01:20,853 --> 00:01:22,636
负责人、日期都能改
You can change the owner and the date.

28
00:01:22,676 --> 00:01:24,460
你点了确认才算数
Nothing counts until you confirm it.

29
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:30,360
确认完，按负责人分好组
Once confirmed, tasks are grouped by owner

30
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,985
生成一条认领消息，复制到群里
into a claim message you paste into the group chat,

31
00:01:33,025 --> 00:01:34,560
各人认领各人的
so everyone claims their own.

32
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:43,210
之后每天早上九点，电脑会弹通知
Every morning at 9, your Mac sends a notification

33
00:01:43,250 --> 00:01:46,160
提醒哪些已经逾期、哪些今天到期
about what's overdue and what's due today.

34
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,555
到了下次开会，转写一完成
At the next meeting, once transcription finishes,

35
00:01:52,595 --> 00:01:54,674
它会把之前没做完的事
it checks the earlier open tasks

36
00:01:54,714 --> 00:01:56,263
和新录音对一遍
against the new recording.

37
00:01:56,303 --> 00:01:59,265
比如小林说样品到了、照片发群里了
Say Xiaolin mentions the samples arrived and the photos are posted —

38
00:01:59,305 --> 00:02:01,560
它就提示把这件标成完成
it suggests marking that task done.

39
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:08,312
对完一遍，逾期从七件剩下一件
After one pass, overdue drops from 7 to 1.

40
00:02:08,352 --> 00:02:11,160
剩下的这件，会上确实没人提
And the one left really wasn't mentioned.

41
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:17,350
想追问，就打开问资料库
Want to dig deeper? Open Ask the library.

42
00:02:17,390 --> 00:02:19,962
我问：小林手上还有什么没做完？
I ask: what does Xiaolin still have open?

43
00:02:20,002 --> 00:02:22,574
问题会交给 MOI 上的智能体
The question goes to an agent on MOI.

44
00:02:22,614 --> 00:02:25,360
它先去知识库里检索，再整理回答
It searches the knowledge base, then writes the answer.

45
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:32,114
回答里每一句都标了
Every sentence in the answer is tagged

46
00:02:32,154 --> 00:02:33,800
是哪场会、第几分钟
with the meeting and the minute.

47
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:36,160
点一下，就回到录音里那一句
Click it to jump back to that line in the recording.

48
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,910
这背后用的是 MOI
Under the hood, it's MOI:

49
00:02:41,950 --> 00:02:43,560
三场会议存进知识库
the three meetings live in a knowledge base,

50
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:45,510
智能体查着知识库来回答
the agent answers by searching it,

51
00:02:45,550 --> 00:02:46,860
提任务和写纪要
and task extraction and minutes

52
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:48,960
用的是 Genesis 模型
run on Genesis models.

53
00:02:50,300 --> 00:02:52,999
散会即开工，网页版打开就能试
Sanhui: open the web version and try it now.

54
00:02:53,039 --> 00:02:54,460
地址在屏幕上
The link is on screen.
